Please challenge exploit, compatibility of call nesting, regression coverage, and guard sufficiency. Avoid unrelated broad audit. Do not demand neutral cotitular behavior of this ACL-only prerequisite.
Primary docs consulted via Context7 /websites/postgresql_17: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/sql-createfunction.html default PUBLIC execute, SECURITY DEFINER runs as owner, restrict grants atomically. https://www.postgresql.org/docs/17/sql-revoke.html.

